{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>וכחכי</b> — the yod in place of the heh, as in <i>לכלא הפשע</i>, where too there is an alef in place of the heh, and these two words are anomalous, for the rule of words with heh when juxtaposed to <i>לכלות לחכות</i>. The meaning: as gangs lie in wait — whoever comes and they strip him — so the company of priests [does]. And behold, he has mentioned false prophets and also the priests." "<b>שכמה</b> — like <i>לעבדו שכם</i>." "And behold, <b>גדודים</b> serves on account of what follows: <i>כגדודים בדרך ירצחו כולם</i>. The meaning: that the priests take priestly gifts by force."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {0 "The phrase 'בסמוך לכלות לחכות' is obscure; translated hyper-literally without smoothing."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:33.854011322Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}